%% DM26-0670

%% Health asked for and written to the graph, as built (2026-11-04, docs/architecture/soft-state.md, "As built: pulled health"). No agent has a heartbeat timer.
%% Seen on u7s the same day: 16 (:AgentHealth), every one healthy. The agent's own decisions are general/health_rejuvenation.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Writer as soft-state-processor
    participant Graph as Neo4j
    participant Cassini
    participant Infra as InfrastructureSupervisor<br/>(in each agent)
    participant Ans as Answerer
    participant Policy as Cedar, then the floor
    participant Health as HealthCheckActor

    Note over Writer: Who is asked is its signed<br/>runtime section agents, seeded<br/>from the catalog. Until a version<br/>arrives no one is asked
    Writer->>Graph: read the histories back, once, before the first round, so a restart keeps them
    Graph-->>Writer: each workload's transitions

    loop every POLAR_HEALTH_ASK_INTERVAL_SECS (60)
        Writer->>Writer: open a round with a fresh id
        Note over Writer,Cassini: Only a workload in its deployed family can be asked.<br/>Dropped if it cannot go now: it would be too late for the round
        Writer-)Cassini: HealthQuery on agent.WORKLOAD.health, for each one
        Cassini-)Infra: the question, with the identity the broker stamped
        Infra-)Ans: answer off the supervisor's thread
        Ans->>Policy: may this asker ask? Action request, on this topic
        alt policy forbids, an asker with no verified identity, the floor refuses, or policy cannot be consulted
            Note over Ans: Dropped with a warning, and no answer
        else Cedar permits, or the floor admits the writer of its own namespace and domain
            Ans->>Health: Report
            Health-->>Ans: status, phase, reason, message, connections, counters, uptime
            Ans->>Ans: withhold the secrets in force and the shapes of a credential from the message
            Ans-)Cassini: the answer on polar-health-replies, stamped with its identity
            Cassini-)Writer: the answer. It alone subscribes
            Writer->>Writer: counts only with this round's id,<br/>and stamped with an<br/>expected identity exactly
        end
        Note over Writer: POLAR_HEALTH_ANSWER_TIMEOUT_SECS (10),<br/>or the next round, closes it
        Writer->>Writer: each workload answering,<br/>unresponsive, or unreachable<br/>(outside the family: drift, warned)
        Writer->>Writer: a transition when its state or<br/>reason changes, at most 20 kept
        Writer->>Graph: one UpsertNodes of (:AgentHealth), an unresponsive one keeping the last answer's fields
    end
